03:08.213 --> 03:11.716
left to hide The cord is looming dark and deep I

03:11.776 --> 03:18.142
cannot rest, I cannot sleep It's a hell of

03:18.222 --> 03:19.444
inconvenience

03:21.265 --> 03:27.320
A fragile temporary defense But I am safe here,

03:27.700 --> 03:32.061
hiding out I kill the fear, I kill the doubt This

03:32.321 --> 03:41.204
is the blue water bunker And I am here with you My

03:41.284 --> 03:42.504
safe person

03:45.145 --> 03:46.746
You'll see me through

04:06.443 --> 04:10.025
But in the dark you take my hand You're the one

04:10.125 --> 04:14.167
who'll understand You and Aubrey here with me My

04:14.307 --> 04:17.769
anchor's in this angry sea The house is small,

04:17.829 --> 04:21.911
